$MDESC::Type = "DELTA FORCE";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0>  Fire Fight" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> 37th Parallel" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> A small squad from the <f1><vServer::teamName0><f0> has become separated from the main platoon on its way to what was a <f1><vServer::teamName0><f0> controlled Landing Zone.  After sighting the movements of the delayed squad, the <f1><vServer::teamName1><f0> have set up an ambush in hopes of scavenging weapons and supplies from the unsuspecting soldiers. " @
"\n<f1>Victory Conditions:<f0>  The <f1><vServer::teamName0><f0> need to reach the <f1>Landing Zone<f0> with the <f1>LandingZoneBeacon<f0> Flag within <f1>15 minutes<f0> in order to rendezvous with <f1>Troop Transport Choppers<f0> to win the scenario. The <f1><vServer::teamName1><f0> defeats the rogue squad by intercepting the <f1>LandingZoneBeacon <f0>Flag and placing it in their outpost bunker. Team Death Match scoring is used to post the individual <f1>Infantry Soldier<f0> performance on the battle field during <f1>Fire Fight<f0> scenarios." @

"\n\n<f0>--- For use with the <f1>DELTA FORCE TRIBES<f0> modification. ---" @
"\n<f1>Map Notes:<f0> DF_Ambushed_v0.1  12/10/00.  Designed by:<f1> Thrax-THC- ODFC" @
"\n<f1>http://planetstarsiege.com/deltaforce/            <f0>email: <f1>thrax@whoever.com";
